# Enforce LF line endings in the working tree on every platform.
#
# WHY: this repo commits byte-faithful artifacts that other laws hash or
# re-derive from served bytes:
#   - tests/fixtures/contracts/{error-codes.json,mcp-scopes.json} vendored
#     verbatim from @phlix/contracts, tag-pinned by error-codes.PIN / PIN and
#     equality-checked by tests/Unit/Contracts/* and the McpScopes law tests;
#   - public/assets/app/... — the vendored phlix-ui webui bundle (~210 files)
#     served verbatim, validated byte-for-byte against the pinned UI tag
#     (S181 "bundle byte-ident" precedent, scripts/report-ui-pin-skew.php);
#   - the server route-manifest snapshots under
#     tests/Unit/Http/Controllers/Fixtures/ (S280 parity, md5 recorded at
#     commit time).
# A checkout that silently rewrites LF to CRLF (git core.autocrlf=true on a
# windows runner) would perturb those bytes and poison every pin — the exact
# failure class fixed in phlix-windows-client PR #46.
#
# Census at adoption (master b83639fa): 900 tracked blobs; CR bytes present
# only in the 3 .woff2 font files below (expected binary), zero text-class CR.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.woff2 binary
